WEBVTT

00:00:28.357 --> 00:00:31.527
and stakeholders in the West
lined up to predict

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:33.821
that Africa  was going to suffer heavily

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:37.784
in terms of COVID-19-related
disease and death.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.411
Those predictions have not come true,

00:00:40.411 --> 00:00:43.164
even when allowing
for the lower reporting rates

00:00:43.164 --> 00:00:46.918
as well as the shamefully low
vaccine access in Africa.

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:49.837
The mortality rate
of the African continent

00:00:49.837 --> 00:00:54.550
has been well below
that of countries in Western Europe

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.677
as well as North America.

00:00:57.428 --> 00:01:01.474
These doom-laden predictions
have not come true for many reasons,